<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Usko lifts yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Usko lifts yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Sept 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     8.13	  vs 7.38</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 2.20	  vs 2.00</p>
<p>    After tax income	34.76	 vs 31.54</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   38.13	 vs 34.75</p>
<p>    Tax			 3.37	  vs 3.21</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.19	  vs 3.95</p>
<p>    Turnover		  431.84	vs 434.15</p>
<p>Div payable Jan 2</p>
<p>on register Dec 13</p>
<p>Full name: Usko Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said the changes and investments made during the past year would enable the company to take advantage of South African electricity utility, Eskom's, expansion plans, and have a positive effect on earnings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
